\enumerate{
\item Find photos: \code{\link[=ft_gbif_photos]{ft_gbif_photos()}}, \code{\link[=ft_inat_photos]{ft_inat_photos()}} and
\code{\link[=ft_download_photos]{ft_download_photos()}} (flowering observations by default), or use your
own: one photo, a folder, or a folder with one sub-folder per species
(\code{\link[=ft_read_folder]{ft_read_folder()}}, \code{\link[=ft_taxonomy]{ft_taxonomy()}}).
\item Process photos with the optional 'Python' back end
(\code{\link[=ft_install]{ft_install()}}, \code{\link[=ft_use_backend]{ft_use_backend()}}, \code{\link[=ft_process]{ft_process()}}): two-pass
'Grounding DINO' detection of the main flower, 'SAM' 2.1 outline,
quality control, photo filter and the full trait set.
\item Keep usable photos with a validated decision rule: \code{\link[=ft_filter]{ft_filter()}}.
\item Check photos and traits: \code{\link[=ft_colour_check]{ft_colour_check()}}, \code{\link[=ft_white_balance]{ft_white_balance()}},
\code{\link[=ft_augment]{ft_augment()}}, \code{\link[=ft_augment_check]{ft_augment_check()}}, \code{\link[=ft_trait_info]{ft_trait_info()}},
