}
Core colour traits, colour names, radial colour pattern, symmetry, petal
number and outline quality can be computed in R alone from a crop and its
outline with \code{\link[=ft_traits]{ft_traits()}} and \code{\link[=ft_symmetry]{ft_symmetry()}}. Reflectance spectra can be
converted to the same colour space with \code{\link[=ft_spectra_to_lab]{ft_spectra_to_lab()}}.
